    <text>
        <body>
            <div xml:id="d597-a7">

                <pb facs="0585" n="511" sameAs="frus:frus1865p2/pg511"/>

                <head>B.</head>
                <opener><seg rendition="#center">[Telegram.]</seg></opener>

                <opener><dateline rendition="#float-right"><date calendar="gregorian"
                            when="1865-03-05"><hi rendition="#small-caps">Sunday morning, March</hi>
                            5</date></dateline>.</opener>
                <p><hi rendition="#italic">To Consul of United States, Queenstown, Cork:</hi></p>
                <p>The Stonewall remains in the same condition. The Niagara and Sacramento are
                    vigilant but insufficient</p>
                <closer>
                    <signed>PERRY.</signed></closer>
            </div>
        </body>
